# Allow-list (D-026): the image gets ONLY what serving needs. Anything not listed
# (data/, .env, .git, notebooks, tests, the challenger model) can never leak in.
*
!alembic.ini
!configs/
!migrations/
!src/
!models/scorecard.json
!models/reason_reference.json
!reports/test_evaluation.lock.json
!requirements/serve.lock
**/__pycache__
